#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:1113
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Blowouts fade more slowly than quality: 47% one session in, 33% after "
#~ "two, about 21% by round 50 and 18% at round 100 — day-to-day form sets a "
#~ "floor that even the Oracle's perfect knowledge can only push to 7%. In a "
#~ "varied club they never fully go away: Competitive+ bottoms out near 39% "
#~ "and even the Oracle blows out 21%, because a ringer, a beginner and an "
#~ "off night make some matches unsaveable."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "เกมขาดลอยลดลงช้ากว่าคุณภาพ: 47% เมื่อผ่านหนึ่งเซสชัน, 33% หลังสองเซสชัน, ราว 21% "
